{"id":8543,"date":"2024-04-23T12:10:12","date_gmt":"2024-04-23T12:10:12","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/?p=8543"},"modified":"2026-08-06T12:53:43","modified_gmt":"2026-08-06T12:53:43","slug":"backlinks-types","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/backlinks-types\/","title":{"rendered":"Types of Backlinks in SEO (15 Different Off-Page Backlinks Types)"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Backlinks &#8211; A highly loved and sought-after work in the digital space. Ask any marketer or business owner, and they will always want backlinks. They are like endorsements that can give your business an edge over your competitors and make your site more credible.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>When you get <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-are-backlinks\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">backlinks<\/a> from top websites, it means they vouch for your content, product, or service, which improves your site\u2019s trustworthiness and authenticity. With quality backlinks from reputed and authoritative websites, you can climb up in search engine results and drive more organic traffic.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Unfortunately, not all backlinks have a positive impact on a website. Only a few businesses are able to acquire the links that actually work and place them higher in <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/serp\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SERPs<\/a> for competitive keywords.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Link building is tricky and you need to have a clear understanding of different backlink types to avoid any mistake or penalty.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What Are Backlinks in SEO?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Backlinks, also known as inbound or incoming links, are hyperlinks from one website to another. They play a significant role in search engine rankings as Google assesses backlinks to determine the authority, credibility, and relevance of a site.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Quality backlinks can lead to organic traffic. Hence, businesses spare no effort or resources when it comes to investing in link building. The more links from reputed websites, the higher the chances of achieving top ranks in SERPs. To learn how to find quality backlinks and build a strong backlink portfolio, sign up for our <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO course<\/a> and get trained by marketing experts.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Backlinks are categorized into two major types:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Do-follow Links<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>These are the most important links in <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO<\/a>, as they tell search engines that the content on the page is trustworthy. These links signify that the linked page offers valuable information and knowledge that can answer a specific search query.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>These are considered endorsements, adding to your site\u2019s credibility and authority. Search engines trust your pages more, which improves their SEO performance, and you can see a surge in their rankings. This will ultimately drive more traffic and make your site a success.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-salary-india\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO Salary in India (For Freshers, Executives, Managers)<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. No-follow Links<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>These may not be as crucial as do-follow links, but they are still considered vital for an effective backlink strategy. These links tell search engines to ignore the content on the linked pages as it\u2019s not relevant. They play no role in search engine rankings.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Now, let\u2019s take a look at different types of backlinks you must be aware of 