lider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\"\n                                       target=\"_blank\"\n                                       class=\"btn view-btn btn-sm\">\n                                        View Brochure\n                                    <\/a>\n                                \n                                <a target=\"_blank\"\n                                   href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_course_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\"\n                                   class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\">\n                                    Learn More\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                \n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">15 Types of Backlinks to Use for SEO<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"638\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/types-of-backlinks-in-seo.webp\" alt=\"types of backlinks in seo\" class=\"wp-image-9767\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/types-of-backlinks-in-seo.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/types-of-backlinks-in-seo-300x187.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/types-of-backlinks-in-seo-768x479.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/types-of-backlinks-in-seo-150x93.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We have listed 15 backlink types, each with its set of pros and cons. As you start building links, it\u2019s important that you understand each of them clearly.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Editorial Backlinks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Guest Post Backlinks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Organic Backlinks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Links from Forums and Comments<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Press Release Backlinks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Acknowledgment Backlinks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Testimonial Backlinks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Links from Images<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Links from Directories<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Influencer-generated Backlinks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Footer Links<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Paid Links<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Badge Backlinks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>PBN Backlinks<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Free Tool Backlinks<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Editorial Backlinks<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Editorial backlinks are outbound links acquired from news agency websites because they find your content valuable. These links come from bug publications and highly authoritative sites that are picky about the links they mention on their platforms. So, you have to craft rich and relevant content.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can gain these links by using services that connect experts and journalists, such as HaB2BW and HARO. Your idea must be unique and backed by data so that it can find a place in leading publications.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Guest Post Backlinks<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Guest posts are a source of authority backlinks and a major ranking factor in the SEO community. You acquire these links by creating and publishing useful and high-quality content on third-party sites within your industry.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Guest posts can be paid or unpaid, depending on the agreement between the website publishing the content and the one acquiring a link. These links are a reliable and integral part of any link-building strategy, as they not only influence your search engine rankings but also drive referral traffic. Moreover, they make your site more credible and relevant within your niche.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Don\u2019t choose random sites to increase the number of guest posts and links. Pick only reputable guest posting sites that accept only well-researched content.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Organic Backlinks<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Organic links are placed naturally because somebody finds your content worth linking to. The person may think your content is beneficial for his readers, adding value to their site and offering valuable information to the audience.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Google considers these types of backlinks in SEO as a vote in favor of your content. So, these links must be organic and unpaid. Develop informative and quality content to increase the chances of gaining these links.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Search engines prefer organic or natural links, so make sure you read all the guidelines related to them.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Links from Forums and Comments<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Forums are platforms where people discuss a certain topic and share knowledge. These channels can help you build links, but you must place your links to educate people and offer information as an industry expert. If you focus on increasing the number of links through forums, you will lack quality, which can adversely affect your SEO.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Commenting under blogs and articles is also a popular way to create links. They are easy to acquire but are considered irrelevant and low quality. Also, search engines don\u2019t consider them while assessing the credibility of a site as they know about comment spam and treat these links with caution.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-projects\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">20+ SEO Project Ideas &amp; Topics (For Students &amp; Beginners)<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Press Release Backlinks<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you want to pitch news or make an announcement, a press release is the best option. It helps you tell people about your business and the latest updates, such as a product launch, upcoming event, or exciting deals.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Along with publishing the news on your site, you also post it on other relevant platforms so it reaches a wider audience faster. If done strategically and wisely, it can help your business gain exceptional brand exposure and support your SEO efforts.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Companies prefer these links to inform the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/target-audience\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">target audience<\/a> about current events or activities and get attention for the brand. Press releases on other sites are a sure-shot way to acquire links from reliable sources, especially from content that is all about your business.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>For these links, prefer branded, CTAs, or natural-looking anchor texts.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Acknowledgment Backlinks<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A business can build acknowledgment links by sponsoring an event, giving away gifts, making a donation, or addressing the audience through speech.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>These types of link building in SEO are best for companies that need to interact with people directly. To create these links, track your competitors to learn about the events they are participating in, find the source of their links, and craft your strategy to make the best of every opportunity.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/dee